---
description: Enforces dependency rules for the Presentation layer.
globs:
  - "**/ui/**/*.dart"
type: AutoAttached
---
UI layer code:
- CAN depend on the Domain layer (specifically Use Cases and Entities, injected into Blocs/Cubits).
- MUST NOT import or depend directly on the Data layer (Repositories, Data Sources, DTOs). All data interaction goes through Domain Use Cases.
- CAN use Flutter SDK widgets and state management packages (`flutter_bloc`).
- MUST handle UI states for loading, success, and error conditions.
- SHOULD implement proper error handling and user feedback.
- MUST NOT contain business logic (that belongs in domain layer).
- SHOULD separate UI components from state management logic.
- SHOULD follow platform-specific design guidelines (Material/Cupertino).